Package: ros-jazzy-serial
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ROS 2 port of the wjwwood/serial library
 Cross-platform C++ library for interfacing with RS-232 like serial
 ports. This is the ROS 2 port used by nlink_parser_ros2, built for
 ROS 2 Jazzy and installed under the configured install prefix (default
 /opt/roboparty) for the RoboParty navigation stack.
